WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:18.240
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:24.290
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:41.060
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.060
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:51.280
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:56.450
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:00:56.610 --> 00:01:01.870
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:07.670
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:12.670
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:17.760
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:22.640
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:28.440
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:34.280
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:41.660
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:46.710
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.710
<i>head to a new stage in their adventure.</i>

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.260
<i>Taichi's party who was adrift at sea,</i>

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:03.720
<i>witnessed a Digimon evolve
after eating another Digimon.</i>

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.180
<i>Surrounded by sea predators,</i>

00:02:07.180 --> 00:02:13.110
<i>the party is saved by their
friends who returned from the real world.</i>

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.730
<i>They were brought back by...</i>

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.490
Hikari, why are you here?

00:02:20.490 --> 00:02:23.990
TO THE NEW CONTINENT

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.050
Hikari... who did you say called you?

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.180
I don't know.

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:47.120
It suddenly became bright!

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:50.520
And then we were back
in the Digital World.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.560
In a flash.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.480
That's... a continent, right?

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.700
And that black lightning...

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.460
I'm sorry to startle you.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:17.060
I just updated your Digivices.

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:19.320
We had ours done too.

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:23.430
I added the communication feature
between your partners and...

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:28.910
the database I extracted
from Cloud Continent's fortress.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:34.370
I put that into the Digivice as a test,
and it worked okay.

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.900
It'll read Digimon's vital signs now,

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.900
enabling it to analyze and display
as much data on them as possible.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.130
I'm sure it'll be a big help from now.

00:03:44.130 --> 00:03:45.340
Wow.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:50.310
Also, we have information
that we need to share with your side.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:53.670
This is an In-Training Digimon
called Zurumon.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:58.630
They were consuming
our world's network data as energy.

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.490
<i>It seems like they're still active
in various places even now,</i>

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:08.100
<i>causing chaos from power failures
and information leakages across the world.</i>

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:14.580
So you mean, even with Devimon gone,
our world's disasters didn't end.

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:16.460
Something much bigger...

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:20.190
I wonder if that's related
to Zurumon's explosive outbreak?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:23.960
Are you okay?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:25.240
You're not scared?

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.990
I'm Agumon.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.330
Agumon...

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:35.670
I'm Hikari Yagami. Agumon, you're cute.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.850
Nice to meet you!

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:40.630
You're not surprised by the Digimon.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:42.300
Huh?

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.830
This is Patamon.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:55.480
I'm Takeru.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.690
Hello, nice to meet you.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.900
Patamon's cute too.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.170
Is Takeru the little brother
you mentioned before?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.030
Yeah.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:10.910
He was called here
as the Holy Digimon's partner.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:12.790
Isn't that...

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.060
Then you're the Holy Digimon?!

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:16.920
Yup!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.650
Wow, what a surprise!

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:23.670
Your appearance
or size doesn't change much from us.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.490
Nice to meet you! I'm Joe Kido!

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.680
I'm your leader!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.240
If you need anything, ask me,
the oldest one here! I'm the leader!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:37.310
That's if you need anything.

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.600
Hey, Hikari,
do you have something like this?

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:42.940
Uh-uh.

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.320
I see...

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:52.090
All right! I'll fly out to scout ahead!

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:53.350
I'll go too!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:54.950
-Wait!
-Huh?!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:56.830
What is it?

00:05:57.000 --> 00:06:00.330
<i>"Is it going to explode?"
"This is bad!"</i>

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:00.330
Now...

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.710
<i>Now there's a problem at NASA!</i>

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.340
NASA?!

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:09.590
<i>There's a system error occurring
on a rocket launch!</i>

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.910
The network's in chaos,
causing a malfunction,

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:15.850
and the pressure of the engine
is suddenly rising!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.850
It seems to be out of control!

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:32.990
It exploded!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:38.000
<i>"That's a crazy explosion!!!"
"It looks like CG."</i>

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:38.000
They're live-streaming the launch,
so a lot of information is going around!

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.180
And now,

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:43.540
the U.S. as well as other nations
are scrambling to gather data!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:58.870
You okay?

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.850
Thank you, Taichi.

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.110
This black lightning's intensity...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:09.490
It's as if it's synchronized
to our world's disasters!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.010
Mimi!

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.490
Palmon!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.840
The black energy's growing...

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.750
The responses online about the explosion
are becoming intense too!

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.250
If this is the Zurumon's doing...

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:28.460
It's the same as the fake Tokyo's
Nidhoggmon and with Devimon.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:35.470
There's someone trying to produce energy
from our world's chaos and use it!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.270
Just as I thought, something's about
to happen in this Digital World!

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:46.150
The Zurumon's activity is just an omen.
In order to solve this...

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.990
We gotta do something about it!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.280
Yeah.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:00.890
Do something about this situation first!

00:08:00.890 --> 00:08:02.870
-I'm gonna puke...
-Joe!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.560
The lightning's getting more intense!

00:08:05.560 --> 00:08:08.420
Isn't it targeting Eldoradimon?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:15.720
Leomon!

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:20.060
Are you okay?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.810
This is no ordinary storm.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.540
All of you escape at once!

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.420
At this rate, we'll fall into the sea!

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:30.820
What about you guys?!

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:34.840
Eldoradimon's wounds
from miasma aren't fully healed.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:37.070
We can't leave Eldoradimon behind!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.330
You guys head for that continent!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.810
I'm sure it isn't a coincidence
that you came here!

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:50.020
To uncover what it means,
you must move forward!

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:51.210
Leomon...

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.770
Everybody, let's go!

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.330
Piyomon, please!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.650
Leave it to me!

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.540
We're going too!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.070
Okay, Tentomon!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:17.280
Piyomon Evolution!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.990
Birdramon!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.790
Tentomon Evolution!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.370
Kabuterimon!

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.020
Joe, hang on! Let's go!

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.170
Please, Gomamo... whoa!

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.360
Gomamon Evolution!

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.210
Ikkakumon!

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.090
Now, get on!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:36.740
Ow, ow, ow...

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.220
Let's head out!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:47.580
Let's meet again, children!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.900
We leave the world to you!

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.760
Leomon...

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.100
You mustn't keep looking back!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:27.040
We must only face forward now...

00:10:27.040 --> 00:10:28.190
Hm?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.690
What is that?

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:35.420
It's too high! I'm gonna cry!

00:10:35.420 --> 00:10:37.250
Don't look down, Mimi!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.200
Only look forward, Mimi-chan!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.450
We're almost at land!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.260
Oh!

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:45.300
Something's there!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.640
What?!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:47.660
Taichi.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.120
I saw a shadow move onshore.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:53.350
Yeah, I saw it too.

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:54.800
Look out, Taichi!

00:10:58.550 --> 00:10:59.360
Oh no!

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.800
A surprise attack!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:02.910
Take Hikari for me!

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:03.990
Y-Yes!

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:05.030
Let's go, Agumon!

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:06.080
Okay!

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.310
Taichi...

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.810
Agumon Evolution!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.900
Greymon!

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:15.820
They're coming!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.410
Wow...

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.580
There's this many?!

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.880
These guys are trying to eat us!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.840
Those are Tortamon!
Seems like they're in the Champion Stage.

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.130
TORTAMON

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.950
Everyone, now's your chance to land!

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:50.310
There's still more?!

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.540
They're seriously annoying!

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.770
Everyone, hold on tight!

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:59.070
Birdramon, go down!

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.510
Greymon, help them land!

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:02.320
All right!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:04.680
Ikkakumon!

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.200
Harpoon Vulcan!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.580
We're here!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:10.680
Gabumon!

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.910
Yeah!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.750
Gabumon Evolution!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:15.790
Garurumon!

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.970
Now's your chance!

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:22.940
Yes!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:24.300
Thanks!

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.660
Thanks for the backup! You saved us!

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:28.470
Yeah!

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:31.330
Ah, that was interesting!

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.380
Wasn't that fun, Mimi?

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:35.980
And she was crying earlier...

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.710
Let's go, Palmon!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:43.360
Palmon Evolution!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.390
Togemon!

00:12:45.390 --> 00:12:47.370
Prickly Bang-Bang!

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.630
What's going on?!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.130
This is...

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:07.640
W-W-W-What?

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.400
Hands?!

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:20.320
What...

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:23.320
is that?!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:51.310
H-How cruel...

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.810
It's survival of the fittest!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.420
That's Groundramon.
Seems like an Ultimate Digimon.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.320
GROUNDRAMON

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:03.960
After eating Tortamon,

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:07.030
Groundramon's body energy
is rapidly rising!

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.450
When we were crossing the ocean,

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:14.120
<i>we saw a Digimon evolve
after eating another Digimon!</i>

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.090
They store energy, so they can evolve!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.840
Groundramon's targeting us!

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:29.860
We're on the menu next?!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.600
Looks like it!

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:35.850
Did we perhaps come
to a really dangerous place?!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:39.620
If we don't win here,
we can't move forward.

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:41.900
Yeah, don't get gobbled up.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:43.860
You too.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:48.700
Everyone, scatter!

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:58.080
-Togemon!
-Ikkakumon!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.680
Let me down!

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:03.880
Prickly... Bang-Bang!

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.800
It won't work!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.880
What an immense power!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.890
I'm not that tasty!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.660
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.890
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.910
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:23.520
Kabuterimon Super Evolution!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.360
Metalgreymon!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.400
Weregarurumon!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.570
Garudamon!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.700
Atlurkabuterimon!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.210
Trident Arm!

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.840
All right! Koshiro!

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.110
Yes!

00:15:46.110 --> 00:15:48.210
Horn Buster!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.090
Kaiser Nail!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.990
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:15:57.990 --> 00:16:00.810
Ikkakumon Super Evolution!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.400
Lilimon!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.560
Zudomon!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.080
Yes!

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:10.400
Now, it's our turn! Go get 'em!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:12.700
Flower Cannon!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.950
Hammer Boomerang!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:21.290
What?!

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.170
It's not over yet!

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:34.300
Did it work?!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:36.430
Watch out!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.820
Yamato!

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:56.530
Don't worry. We're fine!

00:17:00.410 --> 00:17:01.430
You okay?!

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:02.410
Yeah.

00:17:05.960 --> 00:17:06.850
Watch out!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:08.380
Get back, Sora!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:11.090
Shadow Wing!

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:17.760
Garudamon!

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:22.870
Aim for the sides!

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.100
Yeah!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:30.860
Attacks on the skin won't work!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.400
It's like an armor!

00:17:34.950 --> 00:17:36.200
Then...

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.410
Metalgreymon!

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:40.120
Yeah!

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:54.880
Taichi...

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.440
You guys!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:17.400
Once I open Groundramon's mouth,
shoot with all the power you have!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.410
Take this!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.090
Now!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.100
Horn Buster!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.620
Shadow Wing!

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:46.430
Flower Cannon!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.940
Hammer Spark!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:05.330
Giga Destroyer!

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:22.890
We did it, everyone!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:29.560
But to come across
such a difficult enemy so suddenly...

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:34.480
If all the Digimon on this continent
are at the same level...

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.870
Darkknightmon...

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.310
You know that Digimon?

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:59.530
Darkknightmon tried
to turn Patamon into a Dark Digimon.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:01.690
To think we'd meet here!

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.490
Umm, so that's not our ally, right?

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:07.560
Jeez, one after another!
What's with this place?!

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:18.500
Everybody...

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.900
We can still fight, right?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.150
Takeru!

00:20:42.150 --> 00:20:43.300
Patamon!

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:46.070
We're gonna fight too!

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:48.560
With everyone!

00:20:57.900 --> 00:21:00.320
Patamon Evolution!

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:17.080
Angemon!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:35.350
<i>Patamon.</i>

00:22:35.350 --> 00:22:37.730
<i>This Digimon is Takeru-kun's partner.</i>

00:22:35.450 --> 00:22:37.730
LEVEL: ROOKIE

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:40.390
TYPE: MAMMAL

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:43.000
<i>Patamon flaps through the sky and inhales
air with the entire body to fire Air Shot.</i>

00:22:40.390 --> 00:22:43.000
SPECIAL MOVE: AIR SHOT / WING SLAP

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:45.020
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:48.860
<i>Animals with big ears find it hard
to focus from hearing too much.</i>

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>Patamon can tolerate up to
about 80 dB, the noise in a train.</i>

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Wait, but are those even ears?</i>

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.060
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.860 --> 00:23:05.460
<i>The separated children's fight
for survival begins!</i>

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:08.380
<i>Will Taichi and Agumon
be able to survive?!</i>

00:23:08.380 --> 00:23:11.870
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Children's Fight for Survival"</i>

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.990
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
